{"id":"alegri_a","lemma":"alegría","pos":"noun","rank":1434,"glosses":["joy, happiness","Any of various amaranths","Mexican candy made from amaranth seeds with honey or sugar"],"ipa":"/aleˈɡɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"alegrías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-alegr%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto me llena de alegría.","en":"This fills me with joy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152448","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"full","l":"lleno"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ella le recibió con alegría.","en":"She greeted him cheerfully.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514756","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Eres mi orgullo y alegría.","en":"You are my pride and joy.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"pride"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Su corazón estaba lleno de alegría.","en":"Her heart was full of joy.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"full"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Que el nuevo año te traiga alegría.","en":"May the new year bring you happiness!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689448","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"new"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to bring","l":"traer"},null]}]}